$DIR/main.p:21:6: onPanic2 is a second panic handler
    A program has exactly one panic handler, and onPanic (main.p:10) is already
    marked //pu:panic. Remove //pu:panic from all but one of them.
    A kernel has no operating system to fall back on when it panics, so
    Plutonium makes the program choose what happens at compile time, and checks
